  "description": "A powerful .NET library for creating test objects with dummy data using reflection. Simplifies unit testing by automatically generating complex object graphs with sensible dummy values while allowing precise control over specific properties. Supports init-only properties and private constructors.",
  "id": "TesterHelper",
  "isPrerelease": false,
